WEBVTT

00:01:56.060 --> 00:01:56.560
Wha—?!

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:22.490
No way!

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:23.900
Why is his arm—?!

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:26.330
No, more importantly, that form is—

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.090
I-I thought that was a counter-skill!

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.110
That's enough!

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:55.110
You're pathetic, Ornis.

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:57.120
Afleia-sama?!

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:01.180
Brynhildr was once the greatest Valkyrie,

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.560
hunting down many souls for the chief god.

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:07.680
You're the one who recklessly unleashed that sealed power.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:09.870
You brought this on yourself.

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:13.390
Did you want to kill Basara that badly?

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:15.570
Do you think I could forgive some fool

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:19.100
who overreached his station and received your favor?

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:24.500
Your supreme beauty is holy and absolute!

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.110
It must never be sullied!

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:29.900
Protecting it is my duty.

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:32.370
Is that why you'd kill him?

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:34.640
Like you did to the real Sakasaki?

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:37.240
What's wrong with that?

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:41.910
We are gods! Humans are just our eternal servants, aren't they?!

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:45.420
It's true that Sakasaki was the lowest kind of scum.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:48.420
He laid his hands on female
 students without discretion.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.940
He was the type who forced them to accept it despite their tears.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:51.290
<i>Hey, wouldn't it be bad for you if others find out about this?</i>

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.430
So when you went after him...

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.430
<i>So, you know what to do, right?</i>

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:57.780
<i>Don't worry. If you behave, I won't tell anyone.</i>

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:59.730
I overlooked it out of consideration for a comrade.

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:02.810
But this time, I can't overlook what you've done.

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:06.440
Why?! Why do you go so far?!

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:10.860
I-I cannot forgive those who would sully you!

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:13.040
Be they human or worse...

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:16.450
Those abominable, tainted fools!

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:20.440
Watch your mouth, Ornis!

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:23.460
<i>Her</i> blood flows within that child.

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:26.590
I will not forgive anyone who soils the honor of her name,

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:28.760
no matter who they might be.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:32.830
This child is proof that she was alive.

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:36.840
I'll do whatever it takes to protect him.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.250
No, you can't.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:44.850
You can't continue sacrificing yourself for this little brat!

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.250
You...

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:49.740
You should return with me!

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:53.440
To Heaven! To those lofty heights!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:59.370
You can't stop this as you are now.

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:02.930
You sealed away most of your power

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:06.830
as the price for coming to this world, didn't you?

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:08.630
Die!

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:11.140
Toujou Basara!

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:17.330
It's true that I underwent many trials,

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.980
especially from the other members of the ten gods,

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:25.430
but there were still a few who sided with me.

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:29.180
I'm allowed to unleash the same power I once had

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:33.070
for one single purpose alone.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:34.940
You don't mean?!

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:36.600
Yes.

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.510
When it's necessary to protect Basara,

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.450
the seal on my power can be temporarily lifted.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:50.430
Y-You're going to kill me?!

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:52.580
If you truly want to protect Toujou,

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.960
then it would've been better for you to have stood by quietly as he eliminated me!

00:05:56.250 --> 00:06:01.470
I didn't stop Basara in order to save you.

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:02.520
Huh?

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:06.780
I couldn't afford to let Basara continue running rampant.

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:07.980
That was all.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:11.910
And if a god like you is involved in the matter,

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:15.340
then someone like me who is not involved with heroes or demons

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:18.430
ought to be the one to crush you.

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:20.990
I won't let anyone else handle it.

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:25.990
After using me,

00:06:26.220 --> 00:06:29.890
you made Basara question me as well.

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:33.000
Thanks to you, he even pointed his sword at me.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:35.750
How are you going to repay me for that?

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:37.620
So? Ornis?

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:44.760
I'll stand in for Basara and eliminate every single trace of you.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:48.770
A-Afleia-sama! I-I only did it for you—

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.340
I certainly hope you aren't going to say

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:58.820
that was your attempt to beg for your life.

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:04.530
Saying you harmed Basara for my sake

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:07.540
is practically begging me to kill you.

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:16.710
Brynhildr, I'll grant you the soul of the foolish one who tried to harm you,

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:19.420
so bear with it.

00:07:29.730 --> 00:07:32.920
Mio, Yuki, Kurumi...

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.440
You'd go this far for them?

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.940
I'm a little jealous.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:44.450
I'll make it better now.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.430
S-Sensei?

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:04.870
Now, Toujou, expel it all into me.

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:14.390
That's it.

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:16.480
Do as you please.

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:46.520
Sensei.

00:08:48.820 --> 00:08:49.490
To-

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:50.520
Toujo.

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:41.170
Basara...

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:45.250
I'm going to alter some of your memories.

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:48.520
About Ornis. About Sakasaki.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.630
About you losing control. All of it.

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:54.430
It's still too early for you to know.

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:56.790
But one day,

00:09:56.790 --> 00:10:00.460
I look forward to being able to talk to you 
about everything that happened here today.

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:04.970
About my true identity,
 and about the mother of each of you{about your two mothers}.

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:31.250
Long ago, our ancestors were driven
 from our homeland by the hero clan.

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:34.970
There were some heroes who purposely instigated things

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:37.480
and blamed it on us vampires.

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:43.010
All so they could call us a dangerous species and cite that as a good reason to kill us.

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:44.950
That's what happened?

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:47.810
That's why I thought you were here to kill me.

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:50.100
Sorry, Toujou-kun.

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:52.980
There's nothing for you to apologize for.

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:53.870
But...

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:59.220
Tachibana, even if the heroes
 targeted you for elimination,

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:01.120
I would never do that to you.

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:01.660
Huh?

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.620
After all, I'm not a hero anymore.

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:06.500
Toujou-kun!

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:10.670
<i>Tachibana wasn't at fault.</i>

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:13.160
<i>The one who manipulated Donoue,</i>

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:15.970
<i>who caused that twister, all of it.</i>

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:19.180
<i>All of it was a trap set up by Sakasaki.</i>

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:21.530
<i>I know I defeated him.</i>

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:23.760
<i>I can feel the reaction from Brynhildr.</i>

00:11:27.610 --> 00:11:28.620
<i>And yet...</i>

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:34.140
<i>Why does it feel like someone protected me?</i>

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:35.800
Basara-san!

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:40.920
Onii-chan!

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:42.280
Sorry, Basara.

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:44.180
Y-You guys?!

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.910
Basara-niichan...

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:49.330
Well, actually, you see...

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:52.910
I'm glad everyone is safe!

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:53.880
But...

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:59.550
It seems like Mio-sama and the others weren't of very much use this time around.

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:01.260
How troublesome!

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:04.140
Then after I told them that,

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:08.650
both of their pact curses began to activate, so...

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:09.680
Huh?!

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:13.590
Th-Then why is Kurumi in the same position?

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:17.240
I thought it wouldn't be nice to leave her out.

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:22.690
You did this on purpose! You planned this, didn't you?!

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:25.130
No way, it just turned out this way.

00:12:25.130 --> 00:12:26.780
Wait, what are you doing?

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:29.370
Going for clothed play in the bathroom?

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:31.790
Basara-san, you're quite the maniac.

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:33.480
Who's the maniac here?!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:35.350
Now, go on, Basara-san.

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:39.260
Hurry...

00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:42.050
Onii-chan, please.

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:44.260
All right.

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:46.020
I'll relieve you right now!

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:56.520
Onii-chan.

00:13:03.020 --> 00:13:04.020
Basara!

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:06.240
Basara-niichan...

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:10.020
Do it more extremely!

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:23.000
<i>Not yet?</i>

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.180
Basara-san.

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:24.990
Hmm?

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:28.990
Basara-san! If you'd like, use this!

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:35.460
Maria, I heard you've been behaving while you're under house arrest.

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:38.950
Rukia-neesama?

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:40.020
"Nee-sama"?

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:44.660
I've come to convey the decision of our moderate faction.

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:48.150
We'd like to have all of you come to the demon realm with us.

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:03.980
A relic of the demon wars waged in ancient times...

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:07.350
Use it and attack the moderate faction.

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:10.240
That was the missive sent to us by the council.

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:18.340
The annoying ideas of the council nobles are nothing new,

00:14:18.340 --> 00:14:23.000
but ordering us to fight with a recently uncovered relic we haven't properly analyzed yet?

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:24.260
Will you accept?

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:26.260
I have no choice.

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:29.020
There's still the Jin Toujou incident from the other day.

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:34.760
If they order me to regain the dignity
 of the reigning Demon Lord's faction,

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:36.960
I have no choice but to accept.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.960
Luka, how's the analysis going?

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:50.830
Luka!

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:52.410
Yes?!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.340
I succeeded in releasing its seal,

00:14:55.340 --> 00:15:00.470
but I've been having difficulty
 undoing its previous control pact.

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:03.490
It'll take a bit more time and adjustments before you can reforge a new pact with it.

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:04.420
I see.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.430
My apologies.

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:08.730
I will be sure to make the reforging a success,

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:11.010
even if it costs me my life!

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.430
Don't force yourself.

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:15.920
You haven't taken a break for a while now, have you?

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.930
I can't afford to have you collapse on me now.

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:21.520
No! Even if I happen to fall,

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:24.380
there are plenty of other specialized magicians!

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:27.600
I must finish this analysis as soon as possible!

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.890
Don't misunderstand, Luka.

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:32.920
Other magicians have nothing to do with it.

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:36.680
You're the only magician Leohart trusts.

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:38.140
Be more cognizant of that.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:41.650
Your Highness...

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:54.470
The weapon aside, who's going to take command of the assault?

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:55.470
About that...

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:56.520
I'll go.

00:15:57.290 --> 00:15:59.130
Gald? But...

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:02.640
There's no need for you to go along with the council's recklessness.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:06.320
Balflear should remain at your side as your aide.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:08.270
I'm best suited for the role.

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:10.240
I'm sorry.

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:14.760
You're the great general who was the sole survivor of

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:17.720
a duel with that war god who stirred up the demon general.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:19.240
You would have—

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:22.840
No, you should have become the demon lord, yet...

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:24.250
Don't worry.

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:29.070
You're going to defeat the council that
 even Wilbert couldn't completely purge

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:31.880
and rebuild the demon realm from scratch, right?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:36.450
I'll gladly lend you my strength for that cause.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:41.680
Now, all that remains is the question of how to spin a just cause

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:44.190
in order to follow the council's ridiculous orders to attack.

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:46.310
That won't be a problem.

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:50.010
What do you mean, Lars?

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:54.030
The moderate faction has decided to summon Naruse Mio back to the demon realm.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:55.530
What?!

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:59.330
It will finally be your chance to lay claim

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:02.040
to the magic power Naruse Mio inherited from Wilbert.

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:03.870
I see.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:06.250
Summoning the previous Demon Lord's daughter

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:09.180
is a clear act of aggression against us.

00:17:09.180 --> 00:17:13.050
Eliminating that threat would serve as a reason.

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:16.250
That's information worth ten thousand troops.

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:19.080
If it's true, that is.

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:21.310
Are you saying you can't trust me?

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:25.310
Well, I guess it's only natural to question the word of a double agent

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:28.810
who works for both the moderate faction and the reigning Demon Lord's faction.

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:30.630
Not at all.

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:32.420
You're a comrade-in-arms who proved himself

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:36.170
by fighting alongside His Highness in the previous war.

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:39.070
I just tend to worry.

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:42.170
Well, thanks.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:52.310
Ramsus-sama, I've prepared your tea.

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:54.090
Good.

00:17:54.930 --> 00:17:56.090
As for that matter from the other day...

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:58.800
I've received an official response.

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.360
As soon as they prepare for the trip,

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:02.130
they'll be coming to the demon realm.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.480
I see.

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:07.600
I've also heard that an assembly will be held soon.

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:09.100
An assembly?

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:13.200
Claus-sama and the nobles around him have called

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:16.120
for all to attend, regardless of class.

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:19.850
He calls it a gathering of those who support His Highness, Wilbert.

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:23.120
What shall we do?

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:26.300
Leave him alone. For now.

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:28.250
Understood.

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:39.380
Go to the demon realm?

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.330
For what purpose?

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:42.930
I cannot say.

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:45.650
Right now, I'm just a messenger.

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:48.640
I'm not in a position to explain the circumstances.

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:54.010
I'm sure Ramsus-sama will explain the details himself in the demon realm.

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:56.150
Ramsus?

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.430
The leader of the moderate faction,

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:02.660
and the elder brother of our previous Demon Lord, His Majesty Wilbert.

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:05.190
Wilbert's elder brother?

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:17.170
What are you going to do, Mio?

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:19.950
To be frank, I'm angry.

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:25.180
It's far too cruel of them to summon you without giving any reason.

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:27.150
I agree.

00:19:27.150 --> 00:19:29.290
There's no need to force ourselves to comply.

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:31.890
It's dangerous when you don't know what the other party is after.

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:36.190
But, if we turn it down arbitrarily,

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:38.690
we'll probably drive a deep wedge 
between us and the moderate faction.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.600
Don't worry.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:47.080
No matter what happens, I'll remain at Mio-sama's side.

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:49.080
No matter what.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:51.670
Maria.

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:54.220
Same for me, Mio.

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:58.580
All of us will protect you, no matter what.

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:02.090
There's no need to let yourself be driven by their desires.

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:04.620
Basara, but...

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:05.730
Don't worry about it.

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:08.600
Whatever happens, I'll accept it all.

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:11.100
That's what family is, right?

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:14.600
Basara...

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:19.110
Mio,

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:21.110
what do you want to do?

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:33.350
I...

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:42.130
I'll go to the demon realm.

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:45.390
Are you sure?

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:48.430
Honestly, I'm a little scared

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:51.970
of going somewhere I don't know
 without understanding anything.

00:20:52.670 --> 00:20:55.580
But I'm the former Demon Lord's daughter.

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:59.400
Nothing will be resolved by backing down now.

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:00.670
So...

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:03.030
So, I'm going!

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:09.880
It'll mean getting all of you involved again, though.

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:19.080
I said not to worry about it.

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:20.090
Basara...

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:23.000
Yeah.

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:24.780
Thanks!

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:36.420
<i>Father, Mother...</i>

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:39.520
Wow, incredible!

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:40.810
Come here!

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:41.820
Hurry, hurry!

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:44.820
Wow! Awesome!

00:23:03.900 --> 00:23:05.140
<i>Ah, hold on! Hey!</i>

00:23:05.140 --> 00:23:06.220
<i>Basara-san!</i>

00:23:06.220 --> 00:23:07.650
<i>Hey, Yuki!</i>

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:09.320
<i>What are you doing?!</i>

00:23:09.980 --> 00:23:11.160
<i>Maria?!</i>

00:23:10.470 --> 00:23:11.160
<i>Stop that!</i>

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:12.960
<i>I promise to come home...</i>

00:23:13.440 --> 00:23:14.310
<i>with everyone!</i>

00:25:04.780 --> 00:25:06.840
It's a good night to start a journey.
